00:58:08.470 --> 00:58:15.490
<v Dan Fitzsimons>You'd ask us to give up six megaschlucks of gooberschnapp to put just puppies on there?
<v Dan Fitzsimons>“你让我们放弃六兆赫的传输带宽，就为了放一堆小狗？”

